# Bellomassi prototype — frontend environment
# Copy to .env.local. Without this value every integration runs in clearly-labelled Demo mode.
#
# URL of YOUR integration gateway (backend proxy) — see docs/INTEGRATION_GATEWAY.md.
# Never put SMTP/IMAP passwords or the OpenWA API key in any VITE_* variable:
# VITE_* values are compiled into the public JavaScript bundle.
VITE_INTEGRATION_GATEWAY_URL=
#
# Phase 6: AI providers that need an API key (OpenJarvis with OPENJARVIS_API_KEY, Gemini, OpenAI-compatible)
# and backend ML forecasting also go through this gateway. Keyless local OpenJarvis / Ollama can be
# reached directly — configure them in AI Settings (no environment variable needed).
